Package: mid.rank.nma
Type: Package
Title: NMA Ranking Statistics Adjusting for Minimally Important Differences
Version: 0.1.0
Author: person("Tristan", "Curteis", email = "tristan.curteis@costellomedical.com",
  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: The package maintainer <tristan.curteis@costellomedical.com>
Description: An extension of package multinma to adjust for minimally important differences when ranking treatments. Refer to methods implemented in the following article: Curteis T, Wigle A, Michaels CJ, Nikolakopoulou A. Ranking of treatments in network meta-analysis: incorporating minimally important differences. BMC Med Res Methodol. 2025 Mar 10;25(1):67. doi: 10.1186/s12874-025-02499-0. PMID: 40065217; PMCID: PMC11892231.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Depends: 
    R (>= 2.10)
